{%- comment -%} Heart on product cards. The runtime keeps aria-pressed, the label and the symbol in sync. {%- endcomment -%}
<button type="button" data-shop-fav="{{ product.id }}" data-on="♥" data-off="♡" data-aria-on="Usuń z ulubionych" data-aria-off="Dodaj do ulubionych" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Dodaj do ulubionych" class="product-favorite absolute right-3 top-3 grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white text-2xl">♡</button>
